---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Data room — Terravault"
  description="The data room — everything diligence needs."
>
  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:88px 64px 44px;">
    <div data-reveal style="max-width:760px;">
      <div
        style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; color:#9ef27a; letter-spacing:0.03em; margin-bottom:22px; border:1px solid rgba(158,242,122,0.25); padding:7px 16px 7px 8px; border-radius:100px; background:rgba(158,242,122,0.06);"
      >
        <span
          style="width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#9ef27a; box-shadow:0 0 8px #9ef27a; display:block;"
        ></span>For evaluators · under NDA
      </div>
      <h1
        style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,58px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.06; margin-bottom:22px;"
      >
        The data room — <em style="font-style:italic; color:#9ef27a;">everything diligence needs</em>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px; color:#a9a79d; max-width:620px;">
        The primary sources behind every number on this site. Investors and offtake buyers get
        credentialed access after a mutual NDA — no sales gate, just the evidence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px 64px 40px;">
    <div
      data-reveal
      style="position:relative; height:min(42vw,380px); border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);"
    >
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/videos/29941033/solar-power-29941033.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600"
        alt="Terravault facility"
        style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter:saturate(0.85) brightness(0.64);"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
      <div
        style="position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.15) 25%,rgba(9,11,9,0.82) 100%), linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.5) 0%,transparent 50%);"
      >
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute; bottom:28px; left:32px; max-width:520px;">
        <div style="font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#9ef27a; margin-bottom:8px;">
          Sourced from the plant
        </div>
        <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,26px); color:#f4f2ec; line-height:1.35;">
          Real records behind every number — not marketing.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 64px;">
    <div data-reveal style="max-width:640px; margin-bottom:40px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px; color:#9ef27a; letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:600;">
        What's inside
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,38px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em;">
        Seven folders, fully sourced
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal class="tv-grid-2" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:16px;">
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:28px; display:flex; gap:18px;">
        <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:#9ef27a; font-size:20px;">01</span>
        <div><div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">MRV protocol &amp; calibration logs</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14px;">The full methodology, sensor calibration records, and hourly reconciliation exports.</p><div style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6960; margin-top:10px;">14 documents · PDF, CSV</div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:28px; display:flex; gap:18px;">
        <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:#9ef27a; font-size:20px;">02</span>
        <div><div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Lifecycle assessment (LCA)</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14px;">Independent cradle-to-storage emissions accounting behind the 0.87 net removal ratio.</p><div style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6960; margin-top:10px;">3 documents · PDF</div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:28px; display:flex; gap:18px;">
        <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:#9ef27a; font-size:20px;">03</span>
        <div><div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Facility specifications</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14px;">Gen 3 module engineering drawings, throughput, energy contracts, and siting reports.</p><div style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6960; margin-top:10px;">22 documents · PDF, DWG</div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:28px; display:flex; gap:18px;">
        <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:#9ef27a; font-size:20px;">04</span>
        <div><div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Reservoir monitoring data</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14px;">Seismic, geochemical, and core-sample records confirming mineralization and permanence.</p><div style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6960; margin-top:10px;">Live dashboard + archive</div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:28px; display:flex; gap:18px;">
        <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:#9ef27a; font-size:20px;">05</span>
        <div><div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Certification records</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14px;">Isometric and Puro.earth certificates, ISO conformance, and 45Q qualification filings.</p><div style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6960; margin-top:10px;">9 documents · PDF</div></div>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#12160f,#0d100e); padding:28px; display:flex; gap:18px;">
        <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:#9ef27a; font-size:20px;">06</span>
        <div><div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Commercial &amp; offtake templates</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14px;">Standard offtake agreement, delivery guarantees, pricing framework, and shortfall terms.</p><div style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6960; margin-top:10px;">6 documents · PDF, DOCX</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      data-reveal
      style="border:1px solid rgba(158,242,122,0.25); border-radius:16px; background:rgba(158,242,122,0.05); padding:28px; display:flex; gap:18px; margin-top:16px;"
    >
      <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:#9ef27a; font-size:20px;">07</span>
      <div><div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Financials &amp; cap table (investors only)</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14px;">Audited statements, unit economics by facility generation, funding history, and the current round's terms — released to investors after a signed NDA.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 64px 20px;">
    <div
      data-reveal
      style="position:relative; height:min(40vw,360px); border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);"
    >
      <img
        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/10432218/pexels-photo-10432218.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600"
        alt="Facility instrumentation"
        style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter:saturate(0.82) brightness(0.62);"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
      <div
        style="position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.18) 25%,rgba(9,11,9,0.82) 100%), linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(9,11,9,0.5) 0%,transparent 52%);"
      >
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute; bottom:28px; left:32px; max-width:520px;">
        <div style="font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#9ef27a; margin-bottom:8px;">
          Full disclosure
        </div>
        <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,26px); color:#f4f2ec; line-height:1.35;">
          Engineering drawings, specs, and monitoring — the whole picture.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:60px 64px;">
    <div data-reveal style="max-width:640px; margin-bottom:44px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px; color:#9ef27a; letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:600;">
        Getting access
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,38px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em;">
        Credentialed in three steps
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
      <div class="tv-timeline-row" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:110px 1fr auto; gap:32px; align-items:start; padding:26px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);"><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:26px; color:#9ef27a;">01</div><div><h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Request access</h3><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14.5px; max-width:560px;">Tell us who you are and what you're evaluating — a funding round, an offtake, or a partnership.</p></div><div class="tv-timeline-meta" style="font-size:12.5px; color:#6b6960; white-space:nowrap;">Same day</div></div>
      <div class="tv-timeline-row" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:110px 1fr auto; gap:32px; align-items:start; padding:26px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);"><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:26px; color:#9ef27a;">02</div><div><h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Sign a mutual NDA</h3><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14.5px; max-width:560px;">A short, standard confidentiality agreement — countersigned electronically, usually within a day.</p></div><div class="tv-timeline-meta" style="font-size:12.5px; color:#6b6960; white-space:nowrap;">~1 day</div></div>
      <div class="tv-timeline-row" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:110px 1fr auto; gap:32px; align-items:start; padding:26px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);"><div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:26px; color:#9ef27a;">03</div><div><h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Receive credentials</h3><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:14.5px; max-width:560px;">Named, watermarked access to the folders relevant to your review, with an analyst on call for questions.</p></div><div class="tv-timeline-meta" style="font-size:12.5px; color:#6b6960; white-space:nowrap;">Immediate</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tv-container" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 64px 20px;">
    <div data-reveal class="tv-grid-3" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px;">
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:#0d100e; padding:26px;"><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;">Watermarked &amp; logged</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:13.5px;">Every document is per-user watermarked and every view is logged for a full audit trail.</p></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:#0d100e; padding:26px;"><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;">Scoped by role</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:13.5px;">Buyers see technical and commercial folders; investors additionally see financials.</p></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:16px; background:#0d100e; padding:26px;"><div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;">Time-boxed</div><p style="color:#918f86; font-size:13.5px;">Access windows are set to your evaluation timeline and renew on request.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    data-reveal
    class="tv-container"
    style="text-align:center; padding:110px 64px; background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(158,242,122,0.08), transparent 70%);"
  >
    <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,44px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin-bottom:16px;">
      Request data room access
    </h2>
    <p style="color:#a9a79d; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 40px;">
      Tell us what you're evaluating and we'll open the relevant folders within a day of a
      signed NDA.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/enterprise"
      class="btn-primary"
      style="display:inline-block; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b4f792,#1d9e75); color:#06210f; padding:15px 30px; border-radius:100px; font-weight:700; font-size:15px;"
      >Request access</a
    >
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
